@@ -21,6 +21,17 @@ The build will create two jar files:
 * the command line interface in the cli/target folder
 * the interactive explorer in the codeexplorer/target folder
 
+### Landscape report
+
+The landscape report aggregates the repository analyses found under an analysis root. Two names dispatch to the same command with the same options:
+
+* `analyzeLandscape`: analyzes or creates a landscape report (the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands)
+* `updateLandscape`: updates or creates a landscape report (same as `analyzeLandscape`, kept for existing scripts)
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+Run `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -help` for the available options.
+
